{"parse": {"title": "Large salvage", "pageid": 589583, "revid": 15357637, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Large salvage\n|image = [[File:Large salvage.png]]\n|release = [[19 November]] [[2025]]\n|update = Sailing is OUT TODAY!\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = Salvage from a large shipwreck. You can sort through it at a salvaging station.\n|value = 200\n|weight = 3.000\n|id = 32853\n|leagueRegion = No\n}}\n[[File:Large salvage detail.png|130px|left]]\n'''Large salvage''' is an item recovered from [[large shipwreck]]s via [[shipwreck salvaging]]. Level 53 [[Sailing]] is required to salvage these, granting 48 experience.\n\nWhen sorted at a [[salvaging station]] (or the [[Salvaging station (facility)|boat facility]]), players will additionally receive 24 Sailing experience and loot.\n\nAs with all salvage, large salvage can be stored in your ship's [[Cargo hold]].\n\n==Sailing info==\n{{Sailing info\n|name = Large salvage\n|level = 53\n|xp = 24\n|facility = [[Salvaging station]]\n}}\n==Money making==\n{{Mmgsection|Salvaging large shipwrecks}}\n\n==Loot==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=1599836}}\n\n{{Average drop value|killname=|mobname=large salvage}}\n\n{{Average drop value|killname=|mobname=large salvage|alch=true}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Sailors' amulet (inert)|quantity=1|rarity=1/500|altrarity=Never|skill=Sailing|gemw=no|raritynotes={{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/sailing-xp-review--further-fixes?oldschool=1|title=Sailing XP Review & Further Fixes|newsdate=3 December 2025|quote=Let's talk drop rates!|name=droprateblog}}{{Refn|group=d|Duplicate sailor's amulets will not be rolled if the player already owns a sailors' amulet.}}}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Facility bottle (empty)|quantity=1|rarity=1/1000|skill=Sailing|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Broken compass|quantity=1|rarity=1/3000|skill=Sailing|gemw=no|raritynotes={{Refn|name=droprateblog}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Shipbuilding===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steel nails|quantity=1-5|rarity=200/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Teak logs|quantity=1|rarity=200/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Oak plank|quantity=1|rarity=50/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mithril nails|quantity=1-5|rarity=30/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Seeds and frags===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Elkhorn frag|quantity=1-5|rarity=10/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Hemp seed|quantity=1-5|rarity=10/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Cotton seed|quantity=1-5|rarity=5/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pillar frag|quantity=1-5|rarity=2/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Camphor seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Jewellery===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Gold ring|quantity=1|rarity=300/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Sapphire ring|quantity=1|rarity=300/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Emerald ring|quantity=1|rarity=300/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Diamond ring|quantity=1|rarity=200/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Oyster pearl|quantity=1|rarity=200/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Oyster pearls|quantity=1|rarity=200/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Casket|quantity=1|rarity=100/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Giant seaweed|quantity=1|rarity=50/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mithril cannonball|quantity=2-5|rarity=50/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Adamant cannonball|quantity=1-7|rarity=10/2218|skill=Sailing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Soup|quantity=1|rarity=1/800000|skill=Sailing|raritynotes={{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=13/sailing-update-buffs-changes--more?oldschool=1|title=Sailing Update: Buffs, Changes & More|quote=We'll be adding a rare chance (1 in 800,000) to get Soup from sorting Salvage.|newsdate=11 May 2026}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources|Large salvage}}\n\n==Collection log==\nLarge salvage have 3 [[collection log]] items.\n{{Sync}}\n{{Collection log list|cname1=Broken compass|cname2=Facility bottle (empty)|cname3=Sailors' amulet (inert)}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 13 May 2026\n|update = Sailing Changes and Gem Bag Expansion\n|change = [[Soup]] can now be obtained from sorting salvage.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 18 March 2026\n|update = Boat Combat Fixes\n|change = The quantity of mithril cannonballs received has been increased from 1-3 to 2-5.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 5 December 2025\n|update = An Update On the Sailing XP Review\n|type = hotfix\n|change = The amount of experience given when sorting was increased back to 24.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 3 December 2025\n|update = Sailing XP Review & Further Fixes\n|change = The amount of experience given when sorting large salvage was decreased from 24 to 20.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 19 November 2025\n|update = Sailing is OUT TODAY!\n|change = The item was released.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|prerelease = yes\n|date = 5 November 2025\n|update = Sailing Technical Pre-Release\n|change = The item was added to the game but unobtainable.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 14 August 2025\n|update = A PoH Recode & More Fixes\n|change = Added to the beta cache during the [[August 2025 Sailing Stress Test]]. The appearance was updated from the beta.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 3 July 2025\n|update = Introducing a New Renderer for the Official Client!\n|change = Removed from the beta cache with the end of the [[June 2025 Sailing Alpha|Sailing Beta]].\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 26 June 2025\n|update = Sailing Beta - Available Now On Desktop or Mobile\n|change = Added to the beta cache during the Sailing Beta.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n===Gallery (historical)===\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Large salvage detail (v1).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Large salvage detail.png|center|300x150px]]\n|-\n|[[File:Large salvage (v1).png|center]]\n|[[File:Large salvage.png|center]]\n|-\n|26 June 2025 –<br/>3 July 2025\n|14 August 2025 –<br/>Present\n|}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Shipwreck salvaging}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:20:58.410892+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Sailors%27_amulet_(inert)\" title=\"Sailors&#39; amulet (inert)\"><img alt=\"Sailors&#39; amulet (inert).png: Large salvage drops Sailors&#39; amulet (inert) with rarity 1/500 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Sailors%27_amulet_%28inert%29.png?ee149\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"27\" data-file-height=\"27\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Sailors%27_amulet_(inert)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sailors&#39; amulet (inert)\">Sailors' amulet (inert)</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"500\" class=\"table-bg-orange\" title=\"0.2%\"><span data-drop-percent=\"0.2\" data-drop-permil=\"2\" data-drop-fraction=\"1/500\" data-drop-p